Subject: [PATCH] webview: draw pages behind the system gesture handle

Use the same inset policy for the extension Activity and the in-app browser. Keep tappable navigation buttons, cutouts and the IME visible. The real WebView layout regression exercises switching navigation modes and opening and closing the keyboard.
